Part 2: Full V3 Veil Glass Design System Documentation
2.1 Design Philosophy

V3 Veil Glass is a seamless matte slate-carbon theme built on the principle of subtractive design — every element must earn its presence. The system produces interfaces that feel like expensive dark stationery in a quiet room: calm, authoritative, and restrained.

Core Tenets:

Invisible by default — surfaces are transparent until interaction demands they emerge
Color is information — teal and orange are semantic signals, not decoration
Depth through subtlety — glass blur and border opacity create hierarchy, not drop shadows
Motion is narrative — transitions tell the user where they are and where they came from
